#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:7
#: 6a5e73dd957a4690be9cc5ccdf1e8dd9
msgid "Pixhawk6C is the latest update to the successful family of Pixhawk® autopilots made by Holybro, featuring STM32H7 cpus, vibration isolation of IMUs, redundant IMUs, and IMU heating. It comes in two form factors. The 6C Mini reduces the size and has a built-in PWM motor/servo header, at the expense of a bit fewer ports."
msgstr ""

